ind":"announcement","title":"Wild Crazy 8s is in Steam Next Fest","summary":"Next Fest is on, and Wild Crazy 8s is in it. The demo is the full Tame-difficulty run: all nine floors, free, no time limit, your own save.Three weeks to launch. November 11. The wishlist button does more this week than any other week. If the demo earns it, press it.","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-19T17:09:20Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706691604","verified_at":"2026-10-20T18:05:22Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4878180-1841579228671036","game_id":"steam-4878180","kind":"announcement","title":"You Asked, We Dealt: A Sharper Tutorial + an In-Game Rulebook","summary":"Early playtesters gave us a clear note: the practice table teaches the basics well, but some of you walked away with questions — how exactly the scoring works, what the rest of the action cards do, and where to look something up in the middle of a run. That's exactly the feedback we want. Here's what we did about it. A sharper tutorial The practice floor now spells out the scoring math at the moment your first big chain pays out: every card scores ( Chips × Boost ), and your combo grows the Boos","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-22T08:56:04Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1841579228671036","verified_at":"2026-10-20T18:05:22Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4878180-1839676055893854","game_id":"steam-4878180","kind":"announcement","title":"Play the whole casino free — the demo is out now","summary":"Every 8 is wild — and the demo is the real thingThe Wild Crazy 8s demo is live on the store page, and it is not a thin slice: you get the complete nine-floor climb, Lobby to Penthouse, on the opening difficulty. Chain wild 8s, stack House Rules, and take on every boss table on the way up.In the demo:The full first run — all nine floors, every floor bossThe Gift Shop economy: House Rules, card packs, perks, Tricks & BoonsThe Standard deck, tuned for learning when to spend your 8sWaiting in the fu","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-03T04:50:12Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1839676055893854","verified_at":"2026-10-20T18:05:22Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4878180-1839041357030248","game_id":"steam-4878180","kind":"announcement","title":"Every 8 is wild - Wild Crazy 8s launches November 11","summary":"Wild Crazy 8s is a roguelike deckbuilder built on Crazy Eights, the card game where eights go wild. An 8 plays on anything, calls the next suit, and keeps a scoring chain alive. The run: climb nine floors of a neon casino, beat the boss table at the top of each one, and spend your winnings in the Gift Shop on House Rules that warp the math of every card you play. I'm kfancy. I built this game solo, and it launches on Steam on November 11, 2026. A free demo is coming soon, and it won't be a slice","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-24T17:19:55Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1839041357030248","verified_at":"2026-10-20T18:05:22Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-4878180":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T04:49:14Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T04:49:13Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-4878180":"2026-10-26T04:49:14Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"4878180":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T04:49:13Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T04:49:13Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[]},"5005490":{"last_attempt_at